statmod-fortran licensing
=========================

Code in this project derived from the R package statmod 1.5.2 is distributed
under the same upstream license choice:

    GPL-2.0-only OR GPL-3.0-only

Copies of GPL version 2 and GPL version 3 are provided in LICENSES/.

The separately supplied R-compatibility helper module src/r_mod.F90 remains
MIT-licensed. See LICENSES/MIT-r_mod.txt.

The vendored optional Tweedie dependency under src/tweedie_dep/ retains the
GPL-2.0-or-later terms of the previously translated tweedie package. Its
license/notice are under LICENSES/tweedie/.
